{
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "tasks": [
        {
            "type": "cppbuild",
            "label": "构建: 网盘服务器 (g++)",
            "command": "C:/msys64/ucrt64/bin/g++.exe",
            "args": [
                "-fdiagnostics-color=always",
                "-g",
                "-std=c++17",
                "-Wall",
                "-pthread",
                "-static",
                "${fileDirname}/net.cpp",
                "${fileDirname}/http.cpp",
                "${fileDirname}/store.cpp",
                "${fileDirname}/auth.cpp",
                "${fileDirname}/user.cpp",
                "${fileDirname}/filedb.cpp",
                "${fileDirname}/db.cpp",

                "${fileDirname}/main.cpp",
                "-o",
                "${fileDirname}/main.exe",
                "-Wl,-Bdynamic",
                "-lpq",
                "-lcrypto",
                "-lws2_32",
                "-Wl,-Bstatic"

            ],
            "options": {
                "cwd": "${fileDirname}",
                "env": {
                    "PATH": "C:\\msys64\\ucrt64\\bin;${env:PATH}"
                }
            },
            "problemMatcher": [
                "$gcc"
            ],
            "group": {
                "kind": "build",
                "isDefault": true
            },
            "detail": "MSYS2 UCRT64 g++ 编译五个单元 + 混合链接。【为什么必须 -static】本机 PATH 里同时存在 /mingw64/bin 和 /c/msys64/ucrt64/bin 两套运行时（libstdc++-6.dll、libwinpthread-1.dll），前者基于 msvcrt、后者基于 ucrt，混用会导致 exe 启动即退出（退出码 127）。【为什么 libpq 不能静态】MSYS2 的 libpq.a 是残缺的（只有 19 个成员，没有 encnames），pg_encoding_to_char / pg_char_to_encoding 只在 libpq.dll 里，静态链接必然 undefined reference。【解法】-Wl,-Bdynamic 切到动态，只给 libpq 用；再用 -Wl,-Bstatic 切回来，让 GCC 自动加在末尾的 libstdc++ / libgcc / libwinpthread 保持静态。结果：exe 只依赖 libpq.dll（及其 libssl/libcrypto/libintl），其余全部静态，不会踩 127。"
        },
        {
            "type": "cppbuild",
            "label": "构建: 当前文件 (g++)",
            "command": "C:/msys64/ucrt64/bin/g++.exe",
            "args": [
                "-fdiagnostics-color=always",
                "-g",
                "-std=c++17",
                "-Wall",
                "-static",
                "${file}",
                "-o",
                "${fileDirname}/${fileBasenameNoExtension}.exe"
            ],
            "options": {
                "cwd": "${fileDirname}",
                "env": {
                    "PATH": "C:\\msys64\\ucrt64\\bin;${env:PATH}"
                }
            },
            "problemMatcher": [
                "$gcc"
            ],
            "group": "build",
            "detail": "只编译当前打开的文件，输出同名 exe。供 launch.json 的 F5 调试使用（preLaunchTask 按 label 精确匹配，名字必须是「构建: 当前文件 (g++)」）。同样必须 -static，理由见上一个任务。"
        }
    ]
}
